      "Product selection checklist\nLook for products that:\n- Solve a recognisable problem or provide clear utility.\n- Can be demonstrated honestly.\n- Have reliable supply and fulfilment.\n- Have acceptable quality and return rates.\n- Leave room for all costs.\n- Are not counterfeit or restricted.\n- Have a clear customer and use case.\nAvoid products that depend on exaggerated claims, unsafe use, or misleading before-and-after demonstrations.",
