      "Chapter 6 — Route 2: Freelancing\nThe source describes freelancing as selling a skill directly to clients through marketplaces such as Fiverr or Upwork, or through other channels.",
      "It recommends specialising in a specific style or type of work rather than trying to serve everyone. The reason is straightforward: a clear specialisation can make your offer easier to understand and help you charge more when you have the proof and quality to support it.",
