      "Before buying a franchise\nInvestigate:\n- Initial franchise fee.\n- Total setup and working capital required.\n- Royalty and marketing fees.\n- Required location and equipment.\n- Lease commitments.\n- Staffing and training.\n- Supplier requirements.\n- Territory and exclusivity.\n- Renewal and termination conditions.\n- Actual unit-level financial performance.\n- Franchisee satisfaction and disputes.\n- Your ability to operate the business.\nDo not rely only on the franchisor's sales presentation. Review the contract and financial information with qualified advisers, and speak with existing and former franchisees where possible.",
